atlas model

architecture latent-coordinate-atlas
  canonical_name LatentCoordinateAtlas
  family model
  domain Model / Latent Coordinates
  layer model/latent
  semantic_question Which typed coordinate charts carry an exact address, which comparisons between them are lawful, what does a group of addresses become when lifted, and which branch of the hierarchy must change when one occurrence changes?
  purpose The native polytypic extension of LatentCoordinateFabric. An exact address may carry projections in charts whose mathematics match what each preserves -- dense direction (cosine), role-bound hypervector (Hamming), Poincare point (geodesic), place (great circle), phase (wrapped), distribution (Hellinger), subspace (principal angles), acoustic fingerprint (aligned bit error) and trajectory (DTW) -- with typed relations between exact addresses. Groups are addressed twice (a logical address and a snapshot digest over universe, lens, chart version, exact member closure and child snapshots), lift to a different representation type than their members, and lift again into hierarchy nodes with hyperbolic child coordinates and a topology signature. A lens is a typed query program over an exact eligible set with fusion, attempt slice and widening. Exact joins emit typed training anchors and hard negatives. The organ also encodes hashed text, role bindings and an acoustic fingerprint, spectrum and loudness trajectory from PCM.
  maturity implemented
  consumes LatentCoordinateFabric
  consumes AddressPlane
  publishes LatentChart
  publishes NeighbourhoodSnapshot
  publishes TypedAnchor
  node_types LatentChart
  node_types Projection
  node_types Neighbourhood
  node_types NeighbourhoodSnapshot
  node_types LatentBridge
  edge_types member_of
  edge_types performance_of
  edge_types depicts
  edge_types same_subject_as
  edge_types happens_at
  edge_types projected_into
  invariant two projections are compared only within one chart, or across charts through a declared bridge carrying its calibration error, loss envelope and validity frontier; anything else is refused as incomparable
  invariant relations are typed and written only from exact joins; similarity never writes a relation
  invariant a group's snapshot digest covers its universe, lens, chart and version, every member's address with its source digest, and its child snapshots, so a parent references exact child states
  invariant dense members lift to modes and a rank <= 3 subspace with dispersion, boundary exemplars and outliers; distributions lift to a mixture; hypervectors to a bundle; fingerprints to a medoid; groups of groups to a hierarchy node
  invariant after a mutation only groups whose exact member closure changed recompute; a parent recomputes only when a changed child's representation moved beyond the preservation envelope, otherwise the hold is recorded
  invariant reopening a neighbourhood reports each member as exact, drifted or missing against its current projection
  invariant a lens considers only its exact eligible set, skips (and names) charts its query is not projected in rather than imputing them, and widens a strict fusion to reciprocal rank when too few survive
  invariant roles survive binding: role=value pairs bound by XOR and bundled by majority are order-free but swapping roles is a different situation
  invariant a public page links a neighbour only after reopening it against current retained material
  forbidden_inference nearness in any chart -> identity, relation, evidence or truth
  forbidden_inference a group -> a category anyone declared, or a mode -> a genre
  forbidden_inference an acoustic fingerprint match -> the same performance, recording rights or authorship
  forbidden_inference a hold within the envelope -> the parent snapshot being exactly current
  forbidden_inference hashed text geometry -> semantic understanding
  known_gap the charts are hashed text, role bindings and signal features; no learned encoder, S2 cell chart, spectral graph chart or factorized tensor lens is wired yet, and no bridge has a measured calibration
  known_gap competence of any chart for any lens (recall preservation, false merge rate) is not measured; the witness proves structure and maintenance, not quality
  known_gap relation-conditioned training from the typed anchors is not run; anchors are emitted only
  known_gap the estate's standing audio frontier measures 6,241 retained audio items across 50 sources and round-robins bounded sampling by source; the atlas itself is still not wired to AddressPlane advertisements, FactDelta or the inverse compiler
  known_gap the Python LatentCoordinateFabric owner is archived; this organ extends its laws natively but does not import its historical profiles
