  source_path cmd/BonfyreLatentAtlas/tests/link_identities_native_test.sh
  source_path cmd/BonfyreLatentAtlas/tools/audio_family_witness.py.archive
  source_path cmd/BonfyreLatentAtlas/tools/audio_family_witness.mjs
  source_path cmd/BonfyreLatentAtlas/tests/audio_family_witness.test.mjs
  witness cmd/BonfyreLatentAtlas/tests/audio_family_witness.test.mjs proves retained three-source inventory, six-chart projection command closure, cross-chart refusal, mutation, refresh and reopen shape; live remote audio sampling still requires explicit --apply and was not claimed by the fixture
  source_path cmd/BonfyreLatentAtlas/tools/audio_sample.mjs
  source_path cmd/BonfyreLatentAtlas/tools/compile_acoustic_sweep.mjs
  source_path cmd/BonfyreLatentAtlas/tests/audio_sample_test.mjs
  source_path cmd/BonfyreLatentAtlas/tests/compile_acoustic_sweep_test.mjs
  source_path cmd/BonfyreLatentAtlas/tools/link_identities.mjs
  source_path cmd/BonfyreLatentAtlas/tools/link_identities.py.archive
  witness cmd/BonfyreLatentAtlas/tests/link_music_identities_test.sh proves the Bun linker admits only exact source-declared music identifiers and the native atlas holds the imported observation
  witness cmd/BonfyreLatentAtlas/tests/link_identities_native_test.sh proves one-pass native exact gazetteer matching, organizer place over description, exact film credit joins, retained music identifiers, and replay-safe retraction without removing a human-authored relation
  forbidden_inference a gazetteer mention or source-declared music QID -> authority, authorship, or canonical sameness of a file and a work
  source_path scripts/bonfyre_automate.mjs
  source_path scripts/bonfyre_automate.py.archive
  witness cmd/BonfyreLatentAtlas/tests/audio_sample_test.mjs and cmd/BonfyreLatentAtlas/tests/compile_acoustic_sweep_test.mjs prove bounded receipt-carrying acoustic sampling and source-fair native chart projection
  source_path cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/src/main.c
  witness cmd/BonfyreLatentAtlas/tests/latent_atlas_test.sh proves dense and distribution charts and two unbridged dense charts are refused as incomparable, a declared bridge compares with its calibration error, three dense groups lift to modes+subspace over their exact six members, spectra lift to a mixture, three groups lift to a hierarchy node inside the Poincare ball with a topology signature, role bindings keep roles, a small move recomputes only the mutated group and holds the parent, reopening before refresh reports the drifted member, a move beyond the envelope recomputes the parent and still only that branch, a lens skips an unprojected chart and fills its slice from the exact eligible set, and exact joins become typed positives while shared words at different addresses become hard negatives
  witness 2026-09-17 ~/.bonfyre/estate/latent-atlas/audio-family-witness-20260917.json: 24 real recordings from the retained Wikidata recorded-music, Great 78 and Dallas live-music twins were range-sampled under robots admission (sample digests kept, bytes deleted), decoded by ffmpeg and projected into fingerprint, spectrum, loudness, words, roles and season charts; each of three collections lifted to modes+subspace, a mixture and a medoid; the words and spectrum groups lifted into hierarchy nodes; cross-chart comparison was refused; re-sampling one 78 moved its fingerprint 0.49 and spectrum 0.13, refresh recomputed only that collection's two acoustic groups, the collection's mixture moved 0.021 past the 0.02 envelope so the spectrum hierarchy recomputed while the words hierarchy did not, and reopening reported one drifted member before refresh and none after
  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/page_public_commons_test.sh proves an item page links the recording nearest in the atlas's spectrum chart first and stops linking a neighbour once its source no longer publishes it
  witness cmd/BonfyreLatentAtlas/tests/latent_atlas_test.sh also proves an atlas written before a relation type existed accepts that type after its table is rebuilt, keeping every relation it already held, and that every census item is projected into the words chart with its family membership in one pass, that words which have not changed are not re-encoded, that only the item whose words changed is re-encoded, and that a linker forgets exactly the relations it wrote before writing them again
  witness 2026-09-17 the organ built and its law test passed on the estate (GCC 13); the audio-family atlas was installed at /var/lib/bonfyre/latent-atlas/census-recordings.db, reopen reported its 78 rpm spectrum group exact (8 exact, 0 drifted), and a production recording page answered with Sounds similar
  witness 2026-09-25 /private/tmp/bonfyre-audio-frontier-20260925T0730Z/witness.json sampled 36 retained recordings from Wikidata recorded music, Great 78 and Dallas live music under robots admission with zero refusals; every sample retained its range digest while bytes were deleted, the acoustic/spectrum/loudness lens reopened 35 eligible neighbours, and a later sample changed only the affected 78 acoustic branches before refresh restored closure
  witness 2026-09-25 /private/tmp/bonfyre-music-wiki-link-20260925/relations.jsonl projected all 39,314 retained items through the exact Wikidata recorded-music closure and admitted 48 observed_as links with zero refusal; each link carries the retained item address, source-declared QID and Wikipedia page, while the linker test rejects a non-QID and an ident from another source
  witness 2026-09-25 /private/tmp/bonfyre-full-audio-frontier-20260925T1800Z/runs/20260925T180053Z-59889.json ran the source-fair retained-audio batch over 50 distinct sources: 27 new fingerprint, spectrum and loudness projections were admitted and 23 were explicitly refused, leaving the 6,213-item remainder measurable by source instead of pretending an unprocessed item has no acoustic state
  source_lineage 2026-09-17 polytypic addressed atlas: one address, many geometries, recursive typed groups

interaction latent-coordinate-atlas-extends-latent-fabric
  source latent-coordinate-atlas
  destination latent-coordinate-fabric
  relation extends_polytypically
  preserves exact subject addresses, comparability contracts, source digests and the rule that similarity is not identity
  drops the archived Python profile storage
  forbidden_inference a native chart -> an admitted LatentSpacePassport
  invalidates_on chart version, encoder or universe changes
  witness cmd/BonfyreLatentAtlas/tests/latent_atlas_test.sh

interaction latent-coordinate-atlas-offers-neighbours-to-pages
  source latent-coordinate-atlas
  destination page-composition
  relation reopened_neighbours
  preserves the neighbour's exact item address, reopened against current retained material
  drops distances, charts and group snapshots from the page
  forbidden_inference "Sounds similar" -> same performance, genre, artist or recommendation
  invalidates_on atlas projections, retained source bodies
  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/page_public_commons_test.sh
